  "bodyHash": "6124791a9b118e2f",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fuser-images.githubusercontent.com%252f17690401%252f209392408-4ca02c99-e13b-466a-b790-5d1d9ed45dcb.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17690401/209392408-4ca02c99-e13b-466a-b790-5d1d9ed45dcb.png\"></a><br><br>将你所有玩家最喜欢的视角中的讨厌的 Minecraft 地图渲染出来：第三人称。#thirdpersongang<br><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/9296b230044bb4ef07851ff9baa2d04aeb210baee3467abafff1380fa081f08b/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f4f6c31546366382e706e67\" alt=\"Fabric API\" width=\"149\" height=\"50\"></a><br><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/third-person-maps\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/19c375e700980aa635dd13e752323f3998c67ec44121b27c1d47bd16e242c6ca/68747470733a2f2f63662e776179326d7563686e6f6973652e65752f66756c6c5f3433313137315f646f776e6c6f6164732e737667\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fthird-person-maps\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/5f7aff5522c9027739ae9b8e76efd569d703cd19be63c34dad4ee59b92d407b8/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6d6f6472696e74682f64742f74686972642d706572736f6e2d6d6170733f6c6162656c3d4D6f6472696e7468253230446f776e6c6f616473\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/ThirdPersonMaps\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/7ddfebdae127817473e5a0d3916b9562404353e11f988f0459e6bd56fb0170e3/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6769746875622f646f776e6c6f6164732f5065707065726f6e692d4A6162726f6e692f5468697264506572736f6e4D6170732f746f74616c3f6c6162656c3d446f776e6c6f616473266c6f676f3d676974687562\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a></p>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/ThirdPersonMaps#-about\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>📖&nbsp;关于</h2>\n<p>这是一个<strong>客户端模组</strong>. 你所需要做的只是按住一张地图并且采用第三人称视角！地图HUD会像你期望的那样运作：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>实时刷新</li>\n<li>适用于未完全探索过的地图</li>\n<li>支持任何比例尺</li>\n<li>适用于左手和右手</li>\n</ul>\n<p>如果你不喜欢默认大小，你可以在HUD中强制设置地图比例尺。请查看你配置文件文件夹中的文件。</p>\n<h2><a href=\"\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>⚙️&nbsp;配置</h2>\n<p>这个模组高度可定制，并支持与 ModMenu 进行游戏内配置编辑。请查看当前的<a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/ThirdPersonMaps/blob/main/src/main/java/pepjebs/thirdpersonmaps/config/ThirdPersonMapsConfig.java\">配置选项</a>！</p>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/ThirdPersonMaps#-dependencies\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>⛓&nbsp;依赖项</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>需要：\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>可选：\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/ThirdPersonMaps#-changelog\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>📃&nbsp;更新日志</h2>\n<p>更新日志可以在<a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/ThirdPersonMaps/releases\">GitHub 发布页面</a>找到</p>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/ThirdPersonMaps#-media\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>📸&nbsp;媒体</h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/ThirdPersonMaps#standard-map-first-person\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>标准地图第一人称视角</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcamo.githubusercontent.com%252f352e5286dc11e9586698a38fc1572c20ccc262e1ffd9836d14faa3cd6aefc467%252f68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f705739785971362e706e67\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/352e5286dc11e9586698a38fc1572c20ccc262e1ffd9836d14faa3cd6aefc467/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f705739785971362e706e67\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/ThirdPersonMaps#map-rendering-in-third-person\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>第三人称视角渲染地图</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcamo.githubusercontent.com%252f0aab7358b2e103748ce1b9056995a85dfdb3cc2d7dd2bdddce919a5496725287%252f68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f723230656a36662e706e67\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/0aab7358b2e103748ce1b9056995a85dfdb3cc2d7dd2bdddce919a5496725287/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f723230656a36662e706e67\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/ThirdPersonMaps#works-in-left-hand-too\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>左手也可以使用</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcamo.githubusercontent.com%252f4a288968f16747e39f0b2e2249083fb3cf009670441973e4b40d6eb627762edd%252f68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f4a7a59454564792e706e67\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/4a288968f16747e39f0b2e2249083fb3cf009670441973e4b40d6eb627762edd/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f4a7a59454564792e706e67\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/ThirdPersonMaps#plays-nice-with-potion-effects--map-exploration\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>兼容药水效果和地图探索</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcamo.githubusercontent.com%252f9d1e0f6688de03b6a8883dad8004aea3f958a2488206a3745c87dfd47433c8c9%252f68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f705a456b4737512e706e67\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/9d1e0f6688de03b6a8883dad8004aea3f958a2488206a3745c87dfd47433c8c9/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f705a456b4737512e706e67\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
